sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant G as GLB (layer 1)
    participant E as Envoy (Gateway qa)
    participant B as Backend (e.g. SonarQube)

    C->>G: HTTPS to sonar.tqbvzkr.disasterproject.com
    Note over G: public TLS (Certificate Manager), Cloud Armor
    G->>E: HTTP to 8080, reused connection (keepalive 600 s)
    Note over E: no TLS: the GLB terminated it · X-Forwarded-Proto https · listener without hostname
    Note over E: HTTPRoute by Host header, client IP from X-Forwarded-For
    E->>B: HTTP to the Service in the consumer's namespace
    B-->>E: response (up to 120 s)
    E-->>G: response
    G-->>C: response
    Note over E,G: Envoy keeps idle connections 620 s, longer than the GLB
    Note over E: access log without query string
